            "value": "e.g. Maybank / GrabPay / cash float"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如选 25 日，则账期为每月 25 日到下月 24 日。首页预算、分类花费、统计「月」都会按这个账期计算。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如选 25 日，则账期为每月 25 日到下月 24 日。首页预算、分类花费、统计「月」都会按这个账期计算。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. day 25 → period is 25th to next 24th. Home budget, category spend, and Stats Month use it."
          }
        }
      }
